WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,670
Thank you senior for saving your life

2
00:00:01,670 --> 00:00:03,070
Stop doing this nonsense

3
00:00:03,070 --> 00:00:06,070
Just follow the conditions we agreed on before.

4
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:07,070
what conditions

5
00:00:07,070 --> 00:00:09,070
Didn't we agree before?

6
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:10,670
My selling fee is five million

7
00:00:10,670 --> 00:00:12,270
Why, you want to default on your debt?

8
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:14,870
I was confused, senior, don't worry

9
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:16,870
Five million a share will not be less

10
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:20,490
Your Zhengzhou Rail Bureau had better keep your word to me.

11
00:00:20,490 --> 00:00:21,780
Otherwise

12
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:23,510
What were the previous ones called?

13
00:00:23,510 --> 00:00:25,110
Zhao Feng and Song Yunshan's junior

14
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:26,510
That's your fate

15
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:28,300
Zhao Feng Song Yunshan

16
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,780
It turns out that several of them were seriously injured.

17
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,810
It's because I offended my senior
